{
  "mark.6.p1.b1": {
    "text": "イエスはそこを去って、郷里に行かれたが、弟子たちも従って行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p1.b2": {
    "text": "この人は、これらのことをどこで習ってきたのか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p1.b3": {
    "text": "また、この人の授かった知恵はどうだろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p1.b4": {
    "text": "このような力あるわざがその手で行われているのは、どうしてか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p2.b1": {
    "text": "この人は大工ではないか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p2.b2": {
    "text": "マリヤのむすこで、ヤコブ、ヨセ、ユダ、シモンの兄弟ではないか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p2.b3": {
    "text": "またその姉妹たちも、ここにわたしたちと一緒にいるではないか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p2.b4": {
    "text": "こうして彼らはイエスにつまずいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p3.b1": {
    "text": "預言者は、自分の郷里、親族、家以外では、どこででも敬われないことはない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p3.b2": {
    "text": "そして、そこでは力あるわざを一つもすることができず、ただ少数の病人に手をおいていやされただけであった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p3.b3": {
    "text": "そして、彼らの不信仰を驚き怪しまれた。それからイエスは、附近の村々を巡りあるいて教えられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p4.b1": {
    "text": "ふたりずつつかわすことにして、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p4.b2": {
    "text": "彼らにけがれた霊を制する権威を与え、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p4.b3": {
    "text": "また旅のために、…パンも、袋も、帯の中に銭も持たず、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p4.b4": {
    "text": "つえ一本のほかには何も持たないように、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p5.b1": {
    "text": "どこへ行っても、家にはいったなら、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p5.b2": {
    "text": "その土地を去るまでは、そこにとどまっていなさい。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p5.b3": {
    "text": "また、あなたがたを迎えず、あなたがたの話を聞きもしない所があったなら、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p5.b4": {
    "text": "…彼らに対する抗議のしるしに、足の裏のちりを払い落しなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p6.b1": {
    "text": "そこで、彼らは出て行って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p6.b2": {
    "text": "悔改めを宣べ伝え、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p6.b3": {
    "text": "多くの悪霊を追い出し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p6.b4": {
    "text": "大ぜいの病人に油をぬっていやした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p7.b1": {
    "text": "バプテスマのヨハネが、死人の中からよみがえってきたのだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p7.b2": {
    "text": "彼はエリヤだ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p7.b3": {
    "text": "昔の預言者のような預言者だ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p7.b4": {
    "text": "わたしが首を切ったあのヨハネがよみがえったのだ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p8.b1": {
    "text": "このヘロデは、自分の兄弟ピリポの妻ヘロデヤをめとったが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p8.b2": {
    "text": "兄弟の妻をめとるのは、よろしくない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p8.b3": {
    "text": "そこで、ヘロデヤはヨハネを恨み、彼を殺そうと思っていたが、できないでいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p8.b4": {
    "text": "それはヘロデが、ヨハネは正しくて聖なる人であることを知って、彼を恐れ、彼に保護を加え、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p9.b1": {
    "text": "ところが、よい機会がきた。ヘロデは自分の誕生日の祝に、…宴会を催したが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p9.b2": {
    "text": "そこへ、このヘロデヤの娘がはいってきて舞をまい、ヘロデをはじめ列座の人たちを喜ばせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p9.b3": {
    "text": "ほしいものはなんでも言いなさい。あなたにあげるから",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p9.b4": {
    "text": "ほしければ、この国の半分でもあげよう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p10.b1": {
    "text": "何をお願いしましょうか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p10.b2": {
    "text": "バプテスマのヨハネの首を",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p10.b3": {
    "text": "今すぐに、バプテスマのヨハネの首を盆にのせて、それをいただきとうございます",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p11.b1": {
    "text": "王は非常に困ったが、いったん誓ったのと、また列座の人たちの手前、少女の願いを退けることを好まなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p11.b2": {
    "text": "そこで、王はすぐに衛兵をつかわし、ヨハネの首を持って来るように命じた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p11.b3": {
    "text": "衛兵は出て行き、獄中でヨハネの首を切り、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p11.b4": {
    "text": "…少女はそれを母にわたした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p12.b1": {
    "text": "ヨハネの弟子たちはこのことを聞き、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p12.b2": {
    "text": "その死体を引き取りにきて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p12.b3": {
    "text": "墓に納めた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p13.b1": {
    "text": "さて、使徒たちはイエスのもとに集まってきて、自分たちがしたことや教えたことを、みな報告した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p13.b2": {
    "text": "さあ、あなたがたは、人を避けて寂しい所へ行って、しばらく休むがよい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p13.b3": {
    "text": "それは、出入りする人が多くて、食事をする暇もなかったからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p13.b4": {
    "text": "そこで彼らは人を避け、舟に乗って寂しい所へ行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p14.b1": {
    "text": "…方々の町々からそこへ、一せいに駆けつけ、彼らより先に着いた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p14.b2": {
    "text": "イエスは舟から上がって大ぜいの群衆をごらんになり、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p14.b3": {
    "text": "飼う者のない羊のようなその有様を深くあわれんで、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p14.b4": {
    "text": "いろいろと教えはじめられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p15.b1": {
    "text": "ここは寂しい所でもあり、もう時もおそくなりました。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p15.b2": {
    "text": "みんなを解散させ、めいめいで何か食べる物を買いに、まわりの部落や村々へ行かせてください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p15.b3": {
    "text": "あなたがたの手で食物をやりなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p15.b4": {
    "text": "わたしたちが二百デナリものパンを買ってきて、みんなに食べさせるのですか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p16.b1": {
    "text": "パンは幾つあるか。見てきなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p16.b2": {
    "text": "五つあります。それに魚が二ひき",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p16.b3": {
    "text": "そこでイエスは、みんなを組々に分けて、青草の上にすわらせるように命じられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p16.b4": {
    "text": "人々は、あるいは百人ずつ、あるいは五十人ずつ、列をつくってすわった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p17.b1": {
    "text": "それから、イエスは五つのパンと二ひきの魚とを手に取り、天を仰いでそれを祝福し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p17.b2": {
    "text": "パンをさき、弟子たちにわたして配らせ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p17.b3": {
    "text": "また、二ひきの魚もみんなにお分けになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p18.b1": {
    "text": "みんなの者は食べて満腹した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p18.b2": {
    "text": "そこで、パンくずや魚の残りを集めると、十二のかごにいっぱいになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p18.b3": {
    "text": "パンを食べた者は男五千人であった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p19.b1": {
    "text": "それからすぐ、イエスは自分で群衆を解散させておられる間に、しいて弟子たちを舟に乗り込ませ、向こう岸のベツサイダへ先におやりになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p19.b2": {
    "text": "そして群衆に別れてから、祈るために山へ退かれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p19.b3": {
    "text": "夕方になったとき、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p19.b4": {
    "text": "舟は海のまん中に出ており、イエスだけが陸地におられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p20.b1": {
    "text": "ところが逆風が吹いていたために、弟子たちがこぎ悩んでいるのをごらんになって、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p20.b2": {
    "text": "夜明けの四時ごろ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p20.b3": {
    "text": "海の上を歩いて彼らに近づき、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p20.b4": {
    "text": "そのそばを通り過ぎようとされた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:48"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p21.b1": {
    "text": "彼らはイエスが海の上を歩いておられるのを見て、幽霊だと思い、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:49"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p21.b2": {
    "text": "大声で叫んだ。みんなの者がそれを見て、おじ恐れたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:49-50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p21.b3": {
    "text": "しっかりするのだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p21.b4": {
    "text": "わたしである。恐れることはない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:50"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p22.b1": {
    "text": "…風はやんだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:51"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p22.b2": {
    "text": "彼らは心の中で、非常に驚いた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:51"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p22.b3": {
    "text": "先のパンのことを悟らず、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:52"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p22.b4": {
    "text": "その心が鈍くなっていたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:52"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p23.b1": {
    "text": "彼らは海を渡り、ゲネサレの地に着いて舟をつないだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:53"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p23.b2": {
    "text": "そして舟からあがると、人々はすぐイエスと知って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:54"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p23.b3": {
    "text": "その地方をあまねく駆けめぐり、イエスがおられると聞けば、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:55"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p23.b4": {
    "text": "どこへでも病人を床にのせて運びはじめた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:55"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p24.b1": {
    "text": "そして、村でも町でも部落でも、イエスがはいって行かれる所では、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:56"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p24.b2": {
    "text": "病人たちをその広場におき、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:56"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p24.b3": {
    "text": "せめてその上着のふさにでも、さわらせてやっていただきたいと、お願いした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:56"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.6.p24.b4": {
    "text": "そしてさわった者は皆いやされた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 6:56"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
